{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a simulator where every shot is the result of your preparation and experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Here, it\u2019s not only about accuracy, but also about reading nature, noticing details, and acting at the right moment.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/0e53321eff925cbf33fa3706517f7ce2.poster.avif?t=1761722533\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/0e53321eff925cbf33fa3706517f7ce2.webm?t=1761722533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/0e53321eff925cbf33fa3706517f7ce2.mp4?t=1761722533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout the terrain, study animal behavior, and listen to every sound. Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of true hunting \u2014 misty marshes, lakeshores, and flocks in flight, just like in real life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/d81f58ab0363a9c282051abadbf7b4bf.poster.avif?t=1761722533\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/d81f58ab0363a9c282051abadbf7b4bf.webm?t=1761722533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/d81f58ab0363a9c282051abadbf7b4bf.mp4?t=1761722533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Realistic shotgun ballistics</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on real-world testing data: mass, velocity, air resistance, and spread are calculated for every shot. Everything is tuned so each shot feels like real hunting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Wildlife AI with the BAYANAY system</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A global AI managing migration and activity depending on time of day, weather, and season: flocks form, search for food and mates, and react to the player in real time. Flight principles are modeled, including takeoff and landing trajectories, speed dynamics, wind influence, and course changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Authentic atmosphere</i></strong><br>Real bird calls and dynamic sound processing let you determine direction and distance by ear alone. Feel yourself at the heart of a living ecosystem where every sound matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Natural locations</i></strong><br>An open map inspired by the wild nature of Yakutia: misty swamps, lakeshores, and hunting grounds created with a focus on realism and immersion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/2a406a0227e578b5b1e3a006dae66502.poster.avif?t=1761722533\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/2a406a0227e578b5b1e3a006dae66502.webm?t=1761722533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/2a406a0227e578b5b1e3a006dae66502.mp4?t=1761722533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Respect rare species listed in the Red Book: this simulator teaches not only precise shooting, but also a responsible attitude toward the environment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Master your skills here \u2014 and in real life, you\u2019ll never come home without a trophy!</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929200?t=1761722533","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929200?t=1761722533","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/7a392cda6ce1ec7d3924e91e0f76b6de2d4a9418/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761722533","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/7a392cda6ce1ec7d3924e91e0f76b6de2d4a9418/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761722533","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a simulator where every shot is the result of your preparation and experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Here, it\u2019s not only about accuracy, but also about reading nature, noticing details, and acting at the right moment.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/0e53321eff925cbf33fa3706517f7ce2.poster.avif?t=1761722533\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/0e53321eff925cbf33fa3706517f7ce2.webm?t=1761722533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/0e53321eff925cbf33fa