 Feel yourself at the heart of a living ecosystem where every sound matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Natural locations</i></strong><br>An open map inspired by the wild nature of Yakutia: misty swamps, lakeshores, and hunting grounds created with a focus on realism and immersion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/2a406a0227e578b5b1e3a006dae66502.poster.avif?t=1761722533\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/2a406a0227e578b5b1e3a006dae66502.webm?t=1761722533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/extras/2a406a0227e578b5b1e3a006dae66502.mp4?t=1761722533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Respect rare species listed in the Red Book: this simulator teaches not only precise shooting, but also a responsible attitude toward the environment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Master your skills here \u2014 and in real life, you\u2019ll never come home without a trophy!</i></strong></p>","developers":["Nordrise"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929200/a11c2404ccca6f32eb8c30ef993c2244e9129aeb/header.jpg?t=1761722533","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3929200/12565389/ba80a9626b3f5e75abba6d63e9c91714d39e5f4a/1754294685/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759366879","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.